	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:10,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 10360
			},
			"text": " Part 3 You will hear two education students discussing"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:10,360",
				"to": "00:00:16,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 10360,
				"to": 16440
			},
			"text": " an assignment on teaching handwriting to children. First you have some time to look"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:16,440",
				"to": "00:00:19,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 16440,
				"to": 19200
			},
			"text": " at questions 21 to 24."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:30,000",
				"to": "00:00:49,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 30000,
				"to": 49840
			},
			"text": " Now listen carefully and answer questions 21 to 24."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:49,840",
				"to": "00:00:55,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 49840,
				"to": 55520
			},
			"text": " How are you getting on with the assignment on handwriting?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:55,520",
				"to": "00:01:02,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 55520,
				"to": 62080
			},
			"text": " Not too bad. You know, I hadn't realised that children benefit in so many ways from"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:02,080",
				"to": "00:01:08,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 62080,
				"to": 68040
			},
			"text": " learning to write. It's such an important skill, and yet most people think handwriting"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:08,040",
				"to": "00:01:14,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 68040,
				"to": 74160
			},
			"text": " is less important than in the past, because people hardly ever write by hand these days."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:14,160",
				"to": "00:01:19,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 74160,
				"to": 79640
			},
			"text": " Yes, and all the evidence suggests children should learn to write by hand before they"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:19,640",
				"to": "00:01:23,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 79640,
				"to": 83040
			},
			"text": " learn to type, not least because it helps their memory."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:23,040",
				"to": "00:01:29,940"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 83040,
				"to": 89940
			},
			"text": " That's right. The physical act of writing helps children to remember letters. That seems"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:29,940",
				"to": "00:01:32,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 89940,
				"to": 92920
			},
			"text": " pretty obvious when you think about it."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:32,920",
				"to": "00:01:38,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 92920,
				"to": 98000
			},
			"text": " What's less obvious is how it helps develop their concentration. They have to sit still"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:38,000",
				"to": "00:01:39,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 98000,
				"to": 99840
			},
			"text": " and focus on one thing."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:39,840",
				"to": "00:01:44,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 99840,
				"to": 104640
			},
			"text": " Yeah, that aspect of handwriting had never occurred to me before."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:44,640",
				"to": "00:01:50,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 104640,
				"to": 110240
			},
			"text": " Same here. I'm not sure I understand how it improves children's imagination though."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:50,240",
				"to": "00:01:56,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 110240,
				"to": 116440
			},
			"text": " Well, there was that study which showed that primary age children generated more ideas"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:56,440",
				"to": "00:02:01,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 116440,
				"to": 121280
			},
			"text": " when they were writing by hand than using a keyboard. I would have guessed that would"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:01,280",
				"to": "00:02:02,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 121280,
				"to": 122680
			},
			"text": " be the case."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:02,680",
				"to": "00:02:09,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 122680,
				"to": 129800
			},
			"text": " Hmm, yeah. I'd never associated spatial awareness with handwriting either. I thought spatial"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:09,800",
				"to": "00:02:15,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 129800,
				"to": 135680
			},
			"text": " awareness was more to do with knowing where you are in relation to objects or other people."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:15,680",
				"to": "00:02:21,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 135680,
				"to": 141800
			},
			"text": " I thought that too, but good spatial awareness is essential for writing because you have"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:21,800",
				"to": "00:02:27,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 141800,
				"to": 147760
			},
			"text": " to space words correctly. It's not just fine motor skills that improve through writing,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:27,760",
				"to": "00:02:29,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 147760,
				"to": 149680
			},
			"text": " as I'd always assumed."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:29,680",
				"to": "00:02:35,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 149680,
				"to": 155920
			},
			"text": " Hmm, handwriting is so much harder for children with dyspraxia who have problems coordinating"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:35,920",
				"to": "00:02:40,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 155920,
				"to": 160800
			},
			"text": " movement. It's good there are lots of things you can do in the classroom to help them."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:40,800",
				"to": "00:02:45,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 160800,
				"to": 165520
			},
			"text": " They need so much more support with letter formation. You need to play lots of games"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:45,520",
				"to": "00:02:49,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 165520,
				"to": 169920
			},
			"text": " to help them distinguish letter shapes. It takes a lot of patience."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:49,920",
				"to": "00:02:56,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 169920,
				"to": 176200
			},
			"text": " Yeah, I like the idea of using one of those pens that lights up if you press too hard."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:56,200",
				"to": "00:02:58,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 176200,
				"to": 178800
			},
			"text": " That seems like a really simple solution."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:58,800",
				"to": "00:03:04,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 178800,
				"to": 184720
			},
			"text": " Yes, absolutely. I'm not sure there's much you can do about children with dyspraxia writing"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:04,720",
				"to": "00:03:12,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 184720,
				"to": 192000
			},
			"text": " very slowly. It's more important to focus on accuracy and, as they get more confident,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:12,000",
				"to": "00:03:14,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 192000,
				"to": 194440
			},
			"text": " I think they eventually speed up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:14,440",
				"to": "00:03:20,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 194440,
				"to": 200440
			},
			"text": " One quite simple thing you can do is to use grid paper. So they write each letter in a"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:20,440",
				"to": "00:03:24,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 200440,
				"to": 204640
			},
			"text": " box and that trains them to space the letters correctly."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:24,640",
				"to": "00:03:29,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 204640,
				"to": 209200
			},
			"text": " Indeed, that's more important for legibility than trying to get them to write in a straight"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:29,200",
				"to": "00:03:33,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 209200,
				"to": 213360
			},
			"text": " line."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:33,360",
				"to": "00:03:38,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 213360,
				"to": 218440
			},
			"text": " Before you hear the rest of the discussion, you have some time to look at questions 25"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:38,440",
				"to": "00:03:39,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 218440,
				"to": 219440
			},
			"text": " to 30."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:03,360",
				"to": "00:04:32,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 243360,
				"to": 272440
			},
			"text": " Now listen, and answer questions 25 to 30."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:32,440",
				"to": "00:04:44,320"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 272440,
				"to": 284320
			},
			"text": " For some children it might be better to teach them to write on a laptop rather than by hand,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:44,320",
				"to": "00:04:50,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 284320,
				"to": 290040
			},
			"text": " like children with dyslexia. They often really struggle with handwriting and some just give"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:50,040",
				"to": "00:04:51,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 290040,
				"to": 291040
			},
			"text": " up."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:51,040",
				"to": "00:04:56,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 291040,
				"to": 296800
			},
			"text": " Yeah, it's not as frustrating for them if they get things wrong. On a keyboard they can be"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:04:56,800",
				"to": "00:05:03,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 296800,
				"to": 303240
			},
			"text": " more willing to have a go. But I read that developing fluency isn't any faster."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:03,240",
				"to": "00:05:08,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 303240,
				"to": 308800
			},
			"text": " That's right. Did you read that article on the benefits of teaching print rather than"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:08,800",
				"to": "00:05:12,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 308800,
				"to": 312200
			},
			"text": " cursive handwriting, where the letters are joined up?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:12,200",
				"to": "00:05:19,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 312200,
				"to": 319200
			},
			"text": " Yes. Well, in the past cursive writing was certainly considered more stylish and educated,"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:19,200",
				"to": "00:05:26,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 319200,
				"to": 326000
			},
			"text": " but not anymore. Teachers' attitudes have changed because it's been proved that cursive is more"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:26,000",
				"to": "00:05:31,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 326000,
				"to": 331200
			},
			"text": " difficult to learn, especially for children with learning difficulties who find joining"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:31,200",
				"to": "00:05:33,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 331200,
				"to": 333160
			},
			"text": " up letters really challenging."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:33,160",
				"to": "00:05:39,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 333160,
				"to": 339680
			},
			"text": " I agree. I was always worried that my poor handwriting affected my exam results, and"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:39,680",
				"to": "00:05:46,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 339680,
				"to": 346200
			},
			"text": " now research shows that I was right to worry. I'm sure a lot of students think it's unfair"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:46,200",
				"to": "00:05:50,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 346200,
				"to": 350600
			},
			"text": " that they're being judged on their handwriting, not just their knowledge."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:50,600",
				"to": "00:05:55,480"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 350600,
				"to": 355480
			},
			"text": " Marks are definitely affected if examiners can't read the script. That's why it's always"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:55,480",
				"to": "00:05:59,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 355480,
				"to": 359000
			},
			"text": " been so important to teach children to write legibly."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:05:59,000",
				"to": "00:06:04,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 359000,
				"to": 364000
			},
			"text": " Do you think the role of handwriting will change in the future?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:04,000",
				"to": "00:06:10,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 364000,
				"to": 370080
			},
			"text": " I can't see that changing much. Touch typing still isn't taught in most schools, which"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:10,080",
				"to": "00:06:15,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 370080,
				"to": 375800
			},
			"text": " is a shame. But maybe that won't be necessary in the future, because people will also be"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:15,800",
				"to": "00:06:23,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 375800,
				"to": 383520
			},
			"text": " able to write by hand on digital devices. Anyway, teachers understand the value of handwriting."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:23,520",
				"to": "00:06:25,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 383520,
				"to": 385720
			},
			"text": " It's a basic life skill."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:25,720",
				"to": "00:06:31,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 385720,
				"to": 391920
			},
			"text": " True. However, the fact is that people are writing by hand less and less, and relying"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:31,920",
				"to": "00:06:36,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 391920,
				"to": 396620
			},
			"text": " on digital devices. That does cause some problems."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:36,620",
				"to": "00:06:41,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 396620,
				"to": 401080
			},
			"text": " You mean like note-taking. There are lots of apps for that."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:41,080",
				"to": "00:06:47,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 401080,
				"to": 407520
			},
			"text": " And for reading historical documents, apparently. But my mum is shocked by my awful spelling"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:47,520",
				"to": "00:06:52,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 407520,
				"to": 412560
			},
			"text": " and the fact that my punctuation is really inconsistent. I think you can put that down"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:52,560",
				"to": "00:06:53,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 412560,
				"to": 413880
			},
			"text": " to lack of practice."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:06:53,880",
				"to": "00:07:02,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 413880,
				"to": 422120
			},
			"text": " I expect so. Personally, I miss writing by hand. I hardly ever write anything now. I"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:07:02,120",
				"to": "00:07:07,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 422120,
				"to": 427960
			},
			"text": " remember my grandparents had such beautiful handwriting, and it was so individual. Nobody"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
